{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-34","kind":"proposition","title":"求两个整数的最小公倍数","englishTitle":"Given two numbers, to find the least number which they measure.","book":7,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","contentId":"euclid-7-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4143ea835132dbe8d01206632e156e4557f1162dc4f873ba6c7af136cbfbb299","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-34.statement","euclid-7-34.construction.1","euclid-7-34.proof.1","euclid-7-34.proof.2","euclid-7-34.proof.3","euclid-7-34.proof.4","euclid-7-34.proof.5","euclid-7-34.construction.2","euclid-7-34.proof.6","euclid-7-34.proof.7","euclid-7-34.proof.8","euclid-7-34.proof.9","euclid-7-34.proof.10","euclid-7-34.proof.11","euclid-7-34.proof.12","euclid-7-34.proof.13","euclid-7-34.proof.14","euclid-7-34.proof.15","euclid-7-34.construction.3","euclid-7-34.proof.16","euclid-7-34.proof.17","euclid-7-34.proof.18","euclid-7-34.proof.19","euclid-7-34.proof.20","euclid-7-34.proof.21","euclid-7-34.proof.22","euclid-7-34.proof.23","euclid-7-34.proof.24","euclid-7-34.conclusion","euclid-7-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a89ac3154e83c88f6d0b51b0e82c87061ee329edca361ef1510be2b16f666199","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given two numbers, to find the least number which they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给出两个数字 找到它们最少的整除个数字"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fd9375679a2974461a35e7208af2cd0d225fa0abd97795b65c02d578883d017","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be the two given numbers; thus it is required to find the least number which they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是两个给定的数字;因此,需要找到最少的整除个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bbe34a135f5c97efb574f3f91fcb74060a014d824048b50cb17ee1575ec4ea9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A, B are either prime to one another or not."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在A,B 要么互素,要么不是。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1bc9130b4d893e0c905ed16accd857d90c528cdca4814f6b1d8233e520a5dae7","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let A, B be prime to one another, and let A by multiplying B make C; therefore also B by multiplying A has made C. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,A,B是互素,A和B的产物是C;因此,B乘以A, 已经生产了C。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3550e2d5d41b350150ce1c41fba0ff58e721c73d22ef100c96b4022042b03364","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B measure C"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B,整除,C"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aaba42cbf724172da5a65c22072f6cb2660650038d671f1b7ed0c4bd2f0716ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the least number they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,这也是它们最少的整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91579c31da661c55b79cf7c51caa74afcf5a01b1afebdb9825a369dd2d95323e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, A, B will measure some number which is less than C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,A,B会整除, 这个数字还不到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3951599bab506fad06c93ca11487703d1f07dc5bdeec397ebae835112baf6f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19757c307cb6a225b188e4df74a3d56e95b4fd5c15ba3a4c6d473418f628f0e3","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, as many times as A measures D, so many units let there be in E, and, as many times as B measures D, so many units let there be in F; therefore A by multiplying E has made D, and B by multiplying F has made D; [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)] therefore the product of A, E is equal to the product of B, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是A 整除 D,E是单位,F是B 整除 D,F是单位,A是E,F是D,B是B,E是D,B是A,E是B。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"214407b3b1a39f3928993615ab112b9e22dc073803555de3aa3a093f4894846c","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is F E. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A至B,F E也是如此；A 与 B 之比等于 F 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"834d30362fb787d3252e88b1c81770548882075123b736199435a411c05d8af2","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, B are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least measure the numbers which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore B measures E, as consequent consequent."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,B是初级,质数也是最低的,而同样比例的最少整除个数量是相同次数,数量越大,数量越小,数量越小,因此,因此,B,整除,E数量越小。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d00e2a6e49f193dd0efd29ac5872b4f53812669a3ef8e41e3e61171f66cea0e","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying B, E has made C, D, therefore, as B is to E, so is C to D. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以B,E 使C,D,B比E等于C比D；B 与 E 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49742b210489fa0ad967a6ae8b11004ade80011b26b0267517a087fda791f438","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But B measures E; therefore C also measures D, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是B 整除 E, 因此C 和整除 D, 数量越大,数量越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bb26f1bcc39a60458a35d2e466e47b5ef41c3acfb9a670801d916b0d701641f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B do not measure any number less than C; therefore C is the least that is measured by A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B 这个数字不少于C;因此,C是整除为A,B的最少数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82f14292558265c5ae213e5b044be0b621e8c4dddb6fd8f1501e17d8336d8c45","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A, B not be prime to one another, and let F, E, the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with A, B, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] therefore the product of A, E is equal to the product of B, F. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,A,B不是互素,F,E, 与A,B的比例相同者中最少者,A,B的产值等于B,F的产值。 [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a0d829b3faf3c3e4360a4ea7cb88aaf4d1dc568e3b1ddb107b9d137465d5a7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let A by multiplying E make C; therefore also B by multiplying F has made C; therefore A, B measure C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A和E的产物为C;因此,B乘以F计算得出C;因此,A,B,整除,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db1b7d968b123383d18314d7ebfac14891fe2fcd3030334dd9519f15342b8360","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the least number that they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是它们整除中最少的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91579c31da661c55b79cf7c51caa74afcf5a01b1afebdb9825a369dd2d95323e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, A, B will measure some number which is less than C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,A,B会整除, 这个数字还不到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":18,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3951599bab506fad06c93ca11487703d1f07dc5bdeec397ebae835112baf6f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99612917c05cda52cf5b047d04d3dac6980dd9211e1d32af4dde7d669234ac9b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as A measures D, so many units let there be in G, and, as many times as B measures D, so many units let there be in H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A 整除 D, G, 单位, B, 整除, D, H, 单位, H, B, 整除, 单位, D, 单位, 单位, G, 整除, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, 单位, G, 单位, 单位, 单位"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92d1191d0032ac112b35b96fc02cfa45a0845ae84522c84264c629fcaa3b00a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A by multiplying G has made D, and B by multiplying H has made D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以G, 使D, B乘以H, 使D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f78d8f8a85fb24be7abd9fe0413b1e7bf1b117f62db7d739b799aada3bd8d6","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of A, G is equal to the product of B, H; therefore, as A is to B, so is H to G. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,G的产值等于B,H的产值;因此,A对B的产值等于H对G的产值；A 与 B 之比等于 H 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fc498ba9932d88be43188933a8e49ddbf4b2aab4abe72cb45e6b955a0a9e23b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is F to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A比B的比等于F比E；A 与 B 之比等于 F 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23e37ec337e0375b558ff4326aacc8482a6aca9d4d86b965c6a2feb30de632ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as F is to E, so is H to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,F比E的比例也等于H比G；F 与 E 之比等于 H 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eac9def51c9b4916af2e09c6436f0c60beac48d851d9027cce5ee16114c506c6","citations":["euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But F, E are least, and the least measure the numbers which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但F,E是最少的,而同样比例的最少整除个数字是相同次数,数量越大,数量越小,数量就越小;因此,E,整除,G。 [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2907b6f3c80609c0ca769b8dde5b5ab8ffa53bd05f52b268fb192d8bbafa64c1","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying E, G has made C, D, therefore, as E is to G, so is C to D. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以E,G 使C,D,E比G等于C比D；E 与 G 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c95c86114629dbdba935655451fc10a03ba21352160fb5e37e8801e78c2c23a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E measures G; therefore C also measures D, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是E 整除 G, 因此C 和整除 D, 数量越大,数量越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bfe3749d8665ea13ab3c77efbabd863fe10ccb5e3eace6ad2b3187c4cea5c1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B will not measure any number which is less than C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B 将不少于C的任何整除个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":28,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"011cf12424f1ae47a3cfd7eb625e799b784e33a639a747efe0dc60834458db25","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is the least that is measured by A, B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C是整除为A、B、Q、E、D的最少数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-34.source","contentId":"euclid-7-34","revisionId":"euclid-7-34@raw-4143ea835132dbe8","order":29,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f06869e3f3ac8fac0bc43f5ae6062b2b6b4d2030bb202efae6269e3d7158020","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-34:euclid-7-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-34.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"VII. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-34:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-34.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-34:euclid-7-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-34.proof.7","euclid-7-34.proof.12","euclid-7-34.proof.18"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-19","typ